00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.180
Final lesson.

361
00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:54.220
Four

362
00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.060
tracks produced five answers scattered across different

363
00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:57.680
notes.

