379
00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:27.940
Why only five?

380
00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:30.740
Because these are the five things no

381
00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:32.380
system can safely infer:

382
00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.260
what you want,

383
00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.500
where the record is,

384
00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.880
what’s forbidden, how much it may spend,

385
00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.400
and who signs off.

386
00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.360
Meet Paulo, a real estate agent.

387
00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:42.280
He arrived with this in his notes.

388
00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.220
Goal:

389
00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.000
portal leads who reply within twenty-four hours,

390
00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.980
from twenty-five to thirty-five percent.

391
00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.080
Evidence:

392
00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.740
the portal spreadsheet,

393
00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:52.140
one row per lead,

394
00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.380
about eighty a week.

395
00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.320
Never promise an appraised value,

396
00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.840
contact anyone after nine p.m.,

397
00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.860
or promise exclusivity.

398
00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.320
Limit: up to thirty reais a week,

399
00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.980
with a weekly cycle.

400
00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:08.170
Paulo approves, with five days to respond.

401
00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:10.460
Five sentences, the whole worksheet.

402
00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.340
In the lesson,

403
00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:14.680
it appears beside the clinic’s worksheet and

404
00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:16.060
the support manager’s:

405
00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:18.873
resolution from fifty-five to sixty-five percent,

406
00:12:18.873 --> 00:12:20.760
two hundred tickets a week,

407
00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.900
eighty reais a week,

408
00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:23.280
and three days to approve.

409
00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.860
After the five answers,

410
00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:25.840
the

411
00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.640
worksheet gets a second half that you

412
00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:29.340
