413
00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.580
You read it and confirm.

414
00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:32.700
The signal metric,

415
00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.807
if your target is a rate near

416
00:12:34.807 --> 00:12:36.540
three percent, as at the clinic.

417
00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:38.420
The sample size needed for proof,

418
00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:41.480
calculated for your numbers and pace.

419
00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.560
The guardrails with tolerances,

420
00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:46.020
suggested for your kind of business.

421
00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:48.100
And the rollback trigger:

422
00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.400
after a promotion,

423
00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:52.000
if something falls beyond tolerance,

424
00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.560
the card alerts you.

425
00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.027
For Paulo: about

426
00:12:55.027 --> 00:12:56.690
three hundred leads per version,

427
00:12:56.690 --> 00:13:00.600
four weeks, monitoring booked visits and complaints.

428
00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:04.480
One warning: read the metric definition word

429
00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.860
for word.

430
00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:08.580
“Replied” must exclude replies asking to stop,

431
00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:11.340
