432
00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:14.140
The first cycle runs on the spreadsheet

433
00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.460
you already have.

434
00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.360
The Observer counts.

435
00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.180
The Critic only states a pattern with

436
00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.180
thirty rows or more;

437
00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.700
below that, it records the finding as

438
00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:25.400
