464
00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.760
Each guardrail, within or outside its limit.

465
00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:14.840
The cost against the limit.

466
00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:15.940
And the decision:

467
00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:18.700
approve, reject, or wait for more data.

468
00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.320
Without a reply by the deadline,

469
00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:21.780
