494
00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.460
The support manager has plenty of evidence

495
00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.660
and zero experimentation:

496
00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.420
they’ve never compared two answers.

497
00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:26.060
Each starts with the factor at zero.

498
00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:28.150
And you take away a canvas with

499
00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.020
thirteen questions, the

500
00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:32.880
same worksheet extended to any company process:

501
00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:33.780
purchasing,

502
00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.240
finance, marketing.

503
00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:37.800
Your five answers cover five questions;

504
00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.160
the system proposes the rest.

505
00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.240
Now for the final deliverable.

506
00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:43.160
Pause the video;

507
00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.360
this takes about twelve minutes.

508
00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:48.080
The lesson has a form with five

509
00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:50.000
questions and a card.

