528
00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:24.300
Let’s bring the whole course together.

529
00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.220
In

530
00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:26.900
Track One, you saw why the company

531
00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:29.400
