533
00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:31.760
In Track Two,

534
00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.400
you wrote the goal with a number

535
00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.940
and the tracking spreadsheet.

536
00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:35.940
In Track Three,

537
00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.160
you met the loop’s assistants and wrote

538
00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:39.060
the guardrails.

539
00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.080
In Track Four,

540
00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.720
you learned to measure for real:

541
00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.220
what sample size proves a difference and

542
00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.120
